    "description": "Sri Lankan SMEs showcase at 20th China International Small and Medium Enterprise Fair in Guangzhou",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Sri-Lankan-SMEs-showcase-at-20th-China-International-Small-and-Medium-Enterprise-Fair-in-Guangzhou/34-779198",
