    "date_str": "2025-07-19",
    "description": "Economics or entrepreneurship must serve humanity, not just wealth \u2013 PM",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110612/economics-or-entrepreneurship-must-serve-humanity-not-just-wealth-pm-",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
    "time_ut": 1752894060.0,
    "chunk_id": "2025-07-19-adaderanalk-88ca66f6-0000",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "ebb4cb839c464bb7cc386fcd6d5a0e02",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1713,
    "chunk_text": "Economics or entrepreneurship must serve humanity, not just wealth \u2013 PM\n\nThe Minister of Education, Higher Education, and Vocational Education, Prime Minister Dr. Harini Amarasuriya, stated that despite societal tendencies to prioritize monetary value, economics and entrepreneurship should be disciplines rooted in humanity, and the concept of a \u201ccare economy\u201d serves as a good example of this approach.\n\nThe Prime Minister made these remarks while participating in a program held yesterday (18) at the Ministry of Education to inform officials about the development of modules for financial literacy and entrepreneurship, which are included as subjects under the new educational reforms, according to the Prime Minister\u2019s Media Division.\n\nChairman of the Securities and Exchange Commission of Sri Lanka, Senior Professor Harendra Dissabandara, shared his insights on the current state of financial literacy in Sri Lanka and the way forward, and the Chairman of the Colombo Stock Exchange, Dimuthu Abeysekara, expressed his views on the financial literacy activities in the country.\n\nFurther addressing the event, Minister of Education, Higher Education, and Vocational Education, Prime Minister Dr. Harini Amarasuriya stated:\n\n\u201cWe clearly see that your support and blessings have contributed to the new education reforms we are trying to implement. As the Ministry of Education, this brings great strength, and these reforms are more than just curriculum changes.\n\nWhat we need is a developed society\u2014not just economically, but spiritually and ethically as well. Wealth is not just about money.\n\nIn that sense, the transformation we are trying to bring about through education is deeply significant."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_news",
    "doc_id": "2025-07-19-adaderanalk-88ca66f6",
    "num": "adaderanalk-88ca66f6",
    "date_str": "2025-07-19",
    "description": "Economics or entrepreneurship must serve humanity, not just wealth \u2013 PM",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110612/economics-or-entrepreneurship-must-serve-humanity-not-just-wealth-pm-",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
