    "description": "Tamil Nadu Chief Minister Stalin\u2019s Brother Mu.Ka. Muthu Passes Away in Chennai at the age of 77;  DMK leader Kalaigner Karunanidhi\u2019s eldest son Muthu was a Singer and Film Actor Who Tried to Emulate ADMK Leader M.G.Ramachandran.",
