    "chunk_size_bytes": 1630,
    "chunk_text": "Atlas empowers pre-school teachers with skills to unleash the \u2018genius\u2019 in every child\n\nAtlas, Sri Lanka\u2019s leading learning brand, in collaboration with its educational toy range, Atlas PlayPalz, has successfully conducted its 45th training programme across the island and continues to empower the country\u2019s pre\u2013school teacher community through ongoing play-based learning initiatives aimed at enhancing early childhood education. Since its launch in December 2024, this initiative has empowered over 3,500 pre-school teachers, reinforcing Atlas\u2019s commitment to making learning fun and Atlas PlayPalz\u2019s vision of unleashing the genius in every child in Sri Lanka through play.\n\nAtlas PlayPalz\u2019s training programmes are held continuously across all regions of Sri Lanka, consistently empowering pre-school teachers with the knowledge and practical skills needed to implement play-based learning.\n\nCommenting on the success of the programme, Asitha Samaraweera, Managing Director of Atlas Axillia Co. Pvt Ltd, stated, \u201cWe truly believe that every child has a spark of genius waiting to be discovered and through these teacher training sessions, we\u2019re not just sharing knowledge, we\u2019re giving educators the tools and confidence to unlock their potential and make learning a joyful, exciting journey for every child.\u201d\n\nVista Solar Energy wins Best Solar Energy Solution Provider of the Year at Asia Miracle Awards 2025\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
