    "description": "Catholic Church welcomes sacking of ex-SDIG Nilantha Jayawardena",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Catholic-Church-welcomes-sacking-of-ex-SDIG-Nilantha-Jayawardena/56-779254",
