    "description": "Officials say 85 Palestinians seeking aid are killed in Gaza as Israel widens evacuation orders",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110674/officials-say-85-palestinians-seeking-aid-are-killed-in-gaza-as-israel-widens-evacuation-orders",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
