    "description": "Colombo Archdiocese seeks prosecution of sacked former SIS chief",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110687/colombo-archdiocese-seeks-prosecution-of-sacked-former-sis-chief",
    "lang": "en",
