    "description": "Japan faces rice shortage as South Korea battles oversupply",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110695/japan-faces-rice-shortage-as-south-korea-battles-oversupply",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
