    "description": "Harvard heads to court to argue Trump administration\u2019s $2.6bn cuts were illegal",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110702/harvard-heads-to-court-to-argue-trump-administrations-26bn-cuts-were-illegal",
