    "chunk_text": "NCCSL said 145 nominees across 26 sectors and business categories will be unveiled during the ceremony, which will be followed by a gala sit-down dinner and networking opportunities for distinguished guests. The grand ceremony will be graced by the Chief Guest, High Commission of New Zealand to Sri Lanka David Gregory Pine, Guest of Honour, South African High Commissioner to Sri Lanka Sandile Edwin Schalk."
