    "description": "WIPO Global Award winner Dr. Nadisha Chandrasena meets Prime Minister",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/WIPO-Global-Award-winner-Dr-Nadisha-Chandrasena-meets-Prime-Minister/34-779305",
