    "description": "Dy Commissioner of Inland Revenue Dept arrested for soliciting bribe granted bail",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110723/dy-commissioner-of-inland-revenue-dept-arrested-for-soliciting-bribe-granted-bail",
    "lang": "en",
