    "description": "\u201cNo need to arrest ex-CID Director Rohan Premaratne at this juncture\u201d: Bribery Commission informs Court",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110726/no-need-to-arrest-ex-cid-director-rohan-premaratne-at-this-juncture-bribery-commission-informs-court",
