    "description": "DIMO powers Marina Square \u2013 Colombo with state-of-the-art low voltage electrical solutions",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/DIMO-powers-Marina-Square-Colombo-with-state-of-the-art-low-voltage-electrical-solutions/34-779313",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
