    "description": "Indonesia to cut tariffs, non-tariff barriers in US trade deal",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110754/indonesia-to-cut-tariffs-non-tariff-barriers-in-us-trade-deal",
    "lang": "en",
