    "description": "\u2018Red\u2019 warning issued for strong winds and rough seas",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110766/red-warning-issued-for-strong-winds-and-rough-seas",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
