    "description": "Sri Lankan passport makes big jump in global rankings, Visa-Free entry to 42 countries now",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110773/sri-lankan-passport-makes-big-jump-in-global-rankings-visa-free-entry-to-42-countries-now",
    "lang": "en",
