    "chunk_text": "SAJ Associates Founder Jayampathy Arambepola said: \u201cWe are thrilled to work with a big corporate like CIC. For an MSME like me, it is a big boost as we are forward linked with the marketing strengths of CIC Vetcare. Otherwise, we have no strength or capacity to compete with them. Now we have joined hands with them and helping the needs of the local market.\u201d\n\nHe further said, \u201cI also take this opportunity to very warmly thank CIC Vetcare most sincerely for their initiative to work with us. Today many organisations only talk of supporting MSMEs and entrepreneurship. It is a buzzword, but CIC is walking the talk which is most appreciated. Once all goes well, we can dream of the global market with their huge strengths globally with our high-quality herbal and natural products for the much-wanted USD which SL needs. In addition, this important link will help the 750 farmers who grow the herbal ingredients for the product in the NCP with improved incomes which too is a key factor.\u201d"
