    "description": "CIMA Sri Lanka celebrates 60 years of excellence in finance and business",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/CIMA-Sri-Lanka-celebrates-60-years-of-excellence-in-finance-and-business/4-779383",
