    "description": "Chief Justice gives checklist to make Sri Lanka a \u201cJust Republic\u201d",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Chief-Justice-gives-checklist-to-make-Sri-Lanka-a-Just-Republic/56-779413",
