    "description": "Sunshine Holdings celebrates employee excellence at SUN Awards 2025",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Sunshine-Holdings-celebrates-employee-excellence-at-SUN-Awards-2025/34-779463",
    "lang": "en",
