    "chunk_text": "Speaking at the ceremonies, Group CEO Shyam Sathasivam said, \u201cTonight, we celebrate not just individual accolades, but the collective strength that defines Sunshine. As we mark 58 years of this organisation, I want to thank each one of you who stood with me during this transformative year of leadership. The success we honour tonight is the result of your phenomenal work; your resilience, your commitment, and your drive to go beyond expectations. As we look ahead, let perseverance be our defining value, standing shoulder to shoulder, ready to meet every challenge with purpose and unity. This is our roar of glory.\u201d\n\nSunshine recorded resilient revenue growth during the year ended 31 March 2025 (FY25), a consolidated revenue of Rs. 59.3 billion for FY25, reflecting a 7.0% year-on-year (YoY) growth. This performance was driven by strong double-digit expansion in the Healthcare segment, which contributed 55.0% of Group revenue. The Consumer and Agribusiness sectors accounted for 31.6% and 13.4% of revenue, respectively, maintaining a balanced and diversified portfolio.\n\nThe SUN Awards 2025 was a celebration of people, purpose, and pride in performance, echoing Sunshine Holdings\u2019 belief that its people are its greatest asset."
