    "description": "Turkish Minister reaffirms commitment to educational cooperation in meeting with PM",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110826/turkish-minister-reaffirms-commitment-to-educational-cooperation-in-meeting-with-pm",
    "lang": "en",
