    "chunk_size_bytes": 480,
    "chunk_text": "PM vows legal action even against current govt officials over Easter attacks\n\nPrime Minister of Sri Lanka, Dr. Harini Amarasuriya, stated that legal action will be taken even against any officials currently serving under the incumbent government if they are found guilty in connection with the Easter Sunday bomb attacks.\n\nShe made this statement in response to an oral question raised by Member of Parliament Chaminda Wijesiri during a parliamentary session held today (25 July)."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_news",
    "doc_id": "2025-07-25-adaderanalk-b7c6f4e4",
