    "description": "Government to take initiative to establish a National Industrial Planning Think Tank centered on revitalizing the Rural Economy \u2013 Prime Minister",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/government-to-take-initiative-to-establish-a-national-industrial-planning-think-tank-centered-on-revitalizing-the-rural-economy-prime-minister/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
