    "description": "Multi-dimensional approach to lift status of rural sector: Praja Shakthi program in context",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Multi-dimensional-approach-to-lift-status-of-rural-sector-Praja-Shakthi-program-in-context/4-779486",
