    "description": "Emirates Group launches massive talent drive to power its next era of innovation and expansion",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Emirates-Group-launches-massive-talent-drive-to-power-its-next-era-of-innovation-and-expansion/34-779507",
    "lang": "en",
