    "description": "Sri Lanka and Maldives to strengthen diplomatic training through MoU",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Sri-Lanka-and-Maldives-to-strengthen-diplomatic-training-through-MoU/56-779510",
    "lang": "en",
