    "description": "Making friends with former Swedish Prime Minister, 91, at a bus stop",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/making-friends-with-former-swedish-prime-minister-91-at-a-bus-stop/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
