    "description": "UNESCO defers decision to recognise Kapilavastu, a site of global Buddhist significance",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/unesco-defers-decision-to-recognise-kapilavastu-a-site-of-global-buddhist-significance/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
