    "description": "Passengers exit American Airlines flight via emergency slide after aborted takeoff",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110866/passengers-exit-american-airlines-flight-via-emergency-slide-after-aborted-takeoff",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
