    "chunk_size_bytes": 567,
    "chunk_text": "\u201cWe are now engaging in a well-structured public dialogue. We are preparing the system and shaping the necessary shifts in societal attitudes. Everything we are doing is directed toward meaningful social change. Therefore, it is your responsibility to expand this dialogue within society.\u201d\n\nThe panel discussion was attended by Ratnapura District NPP Member of Parliament Nilusha Lakmali, Mayor of Ratnapura Mr. Indrajith Katugampola, and many municipal and local council members of the NPP from the Ratnapura District, along with a large number of NPP activists."
