    "description": "Who protects the vulnerable? Reframing role of Police in preventing gendered harassment in Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/Who-protects-the-vulnerable-Reframing-role-of-Police-in-preventing-gendered-harassment-in-Sri-Lanka/14-779530",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
