    "description": "Crane truck driver involved in fatal Borella accident tests positive for cannabis",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110915/crane-truck-driver-involved-in-fatal-borella-accident-tests-positive-for-cannabis-",
    "lang": "en",
