    "chunk_text": "Thailand and Cambodia agree to ceasefire - Malaysia PM\n\nThe leaders of Thailand and Cambodia have agreed to an immediate and unconditional ceasefire to end their border clashes, Malaysian Prime Minister Anwar Ibrahim said on Monday, following talks in Malaysia between the two Southeast Asian neighbours."
