    "description": "Sri Lanka is a trusted destination for Maldivian investments \u2013 President AKD",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110935/sri-lanka-is-a-trusted-destination-for-maldivian-investments-president-akd",
    "lang": "en",
