    "description": "BRICS targeted in South Asia\u2019s efforts to diversify textile exports \u2013 Industry specialist",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/brics-targeted-in-south-asias-efforts-to-diversify-textile-exports-industry-specialist/",
