    "description": "38 Years Since Indo-Sri Lanka Accord: Time to Honour The 13th Amendment & Hold Provincial Elections",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.colombotelegraph.com/index.php/38-years-since-indo-sri-lanka-accord-time-to-honour-the-13th-amendment-hold-provincial-elections/",
    "lang": "en",
