    "date_str": "2025-07-29",
    "description": "Maritime security, blue economy discussed during Sri Lanka leader\u2019s Maldives visit",
    "url_metadata": "https://economynext.com/maritime-security-blue-economy-discussed-during-sri-lanka-leaders-maldives-visit-233443/",
