    "description": "IMF upgrades world, India, China growth on lower Trump tariffs, warns on fiscal risks",
    "url_metadata": "https://economynext.com/imf-upgrades-world-india-china-growth-on-lower-trump-tariffs-warns-on-fiscal-risks-233473/",
    "lang": "en",
