    "description": "X-Press Pearl compensation money should not disappear into the Treasury\u2019s Black Box \u2013 Environmentalists",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/x-press-pearl-compensation-money-should-not-disappear-into-the-treasurys-black-box-environmentalists/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
