    "description": "UK to recognise Palestinian state unless Israel meets conditions",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/110986/uk-to-recognise-palestinian-state-unless-israel-meets-conditions",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
    "time_ut": 1753838880.0,
