    "description": "Sri Lanka and Switzerland strengthen migration partnership at third expert meeting",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111015/sri-lanka-and-switzerland-strengthen-migration-partnership-at-third-expert-meeting",
