    "chunk_text": "Speaking to the exporters, Minister Handunnetti stated that systematic solutions will be provided to address the challenges faced by exporters and that all necessary interventions will be made to provide the required facilities.\n\nThis initiative is implemented by the Sri Lanka Export Development Board in alignment with the National Export Strategy and operates with the objective of creating regionally balanced and equitable export development."
