    "description": "Sri Lanka and T\u00fcrkiye chart new path of cooperation at 3rd JCETC session",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Sri-Lanka-and-T\u00fcrkiye-chart-new-path-of-cooperation-at-3rd-JCETC-session/34-779712",
    "lang": "en",
