    "description": "EFL welcomes Govt.\u2019s latest move on Wedithalathive Nature Reserve",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/EFL-welcomes-Govt-s-latest-move-on-Wedithalathive-Nature-Reserve/56-779714",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
