    "description": "Trump announces deal to impose 15% tariff on South Korea",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111026/trump-announces-deal-to-impose-15-tariff-on-south-korea",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
    "time_ut": 1753929300.0,
