    "md5": "c77feee66dcf0cf0b02f7eceb31985f2",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1746,
    "chunk_text": "CH 17 and The Expertin collaborate to elevate CRM and loyalty solutions in Sri Lanka\n\nCH 17 and The Expertin have formalised a strategic partnership to enhance customer relationship management (CRM) and loyalty solutions across a broad range of industries in Sri Lanka. This collaboration brings together two specialised entities with distinct yet complementary expertise in loyalty technology, marketing, business strategy, and digital transformation.\n\nSince its inception in 2013, CH 17 has developed into a recognised leader in loyalty management systems. The company\u2019s platform integrates seamlessly with a variety of third-party technologies, including point-of-sale (POS) systems, CRM platforms, email marketing tools, and SMS gateways. This enables businesses to deliver consistent, data-driven experiences while gaining a comprehensive understanding of customer behaviour.\n\nAt the core of CH 17\u2019s offering are advanced features such as gamified rewards, personalised messaging, and targeted promotions. These tools are designed to help companies retain customers and boost engagement. The platform is flexible and scalable, making it suitable for a wide spectrum of customer segments and business models. With its intuitive interface, it ensures a smooth experience for both administrators and end users.\n\nThe Expertin adds value to this collaboration through its strong foundation in business transformation. The company operates across four main verticals: Strategic Realignment, Knowledge Management, Integrated Marketing, and Technological Integrations. Its services are aimed at helping businesses align operations with strategic goals, enhance workforce capabilities, and integrate the right technologies for sustainable growth."
