    "description": "Story of Wa\u2019el Zuaiter comes alive in Colombo today",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Story-of-Wa-el-Zuaiter-comes-alive-in-Colombo-today/56-779738",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
