    "description": "Pearl of a judgement for pearl of contention",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Pearl-of-a-judgement-for-pearl-of-contention/4-779756",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
