    "description": "AI at work: Why CEOs  and HR must lead the charge",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/AI-at-work-Why-CEOs-and-HR-must-lead-the-charge/14-779762",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
