    "description": "Seat belts mandatory for expressway bus passengers from Sep. 1?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111062/seat-belts-mandatory-for-expressway-bus-passengers-from-sep-1",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
    "time_ut": 1754019060.0,
    "chunk_id": "2025-08-01-adaderanalk-1ed84ef5-0000",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "c9b3b88c48435ddc1461357b9a3db39d",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 793,
    "chunk_text": "Seat belts mandatory for expressway bus passengers from Sep. 1?\n\nEffective from today (August 1), it is now mandatory for all passengers travelling in the rear seats of light vehicles on expressways to wear seat belts.\n\nAccording to police, special inspections will be carried out to ensure compliance with this new safety regulation.\n\nMeanwhile, the National Transport Commission (NTC) has announced that, starting from September 1, all passengers travelling in passenger buses on expressways will also be required to wear seat belts.\n\nNTC Chairman, Engineer P.A. Chandrapala, highlighted the importance of this measure, stating:\n\n\u201cThere is a need to ensure that all passengers, including the driver, wear seat belts in passenger buses operating on expressways from the 1st of September.\u201d"
  },
