    "description": "\u201cHeartily pleased\u201d \u2013 MP Harsha thanks all who contributed to US tariff relief",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111063/heartily-pleased-mp-harsha-thanks-all-who-contributed-to-us-tariff-relief",
    "lang": "en",
