    "description": "Hatton National Bank and Nucleus Software collaborate to enhance transaction banking experience with FinnAxia\u00ae",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/hatton-national-bank-and-nucleus-software-collaborate-to-enhance-transaction-banking-experience-with-finnaxia/",
