    "description": "Three years after Aragalaya: bring on the next revolution",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Three-years-after-Aragalaya-bring-on-the-next-revolution/4-779785",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
