    "description": "Intex Sri Lanka 2025 showcases  South Asian textile and apparel industry",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Intex-Sri-Lanka-2025-showcases-South-Asian-textile-and-apparel-industry/34-779805",
    "lang": "en",
