    "description": "Fairly heavy rainfall expected in parts of the island",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111082/fairly-heavy-rainfall-expected-in-parts-of-the-island-",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
