    "description": "B.Saroja Devi: Sparkling Actress  Hailed as the \u201cKannadathup Painkili\u201d (Kannada Parrot)  was also  Praised as  the \u201cAbhinaya  Saraswathi\u201d (Goddess of Expression)",
