    "description": "Validity period of PIN issued for submission of tax returns for 2024/2025 extended",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111122/validity-period-of-pin-issued-for-submission-of-tax-returns-for-20242025-extended",
    "lang": "en",
